1
00:04:36,666 --> 00:04:42,666
When you raise Hell...the Devil must be paid - in full!

2
00:09:13,333 --> 00:09:19,333
Rock 'n' Roll Nightmare is a horror, music film directed by John Fasano.

3
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:56,000
At an old farmhouse, a family mysteriously dissapears at the hands of evil.

4
00:18:26,666 --> 00:18:32,666
Years later, hair metal band The Tritons comes to the farmhouse,
whose barn now features a 24-track recording studio.

5
00:23:03,333 --> 00:23:09,333
Lead singer John Triton gets the band to perform their first night in the farmhouse after dinner,
and weird little beasties suddenly appear, and strange things start to happen.

6
00:27:40,000 --> 00:27:46,000
Band members (and their tagalong girlfriends) begin to
act strangely and vanish one by one.

7
00:32:16,666 --> 00:32:22,666
Soon, only John Triton remains, and he holds a secret.

8
00:36:53,333 --> 00:36:59,333
Finally, the evil shows itself and a battle between heaven and hell ensues....

9
00:41:30,000 --> 00:41:36,000
John Triton, played by Jon Mikl Thor.

10
00:46:06,666 --> 00:46:12,666
Lou Anne, played by Jillian Peri.

11
00:50:43,333 --> 00:50:49,333
Roger Eburt, played by Frank Dietz.

12
00:55:20,000 --> 00:55:26,000
Randy, played by Teresa Simpson.

13
00:59:56,666 --> 01:00:02,666
Phil, played by Adam Fried.

14
01:04:33,333 --> 01:04:39,333
Dee Dee, played by Denise Dicandia.

15
01:09:10,000 --> 01:09:16,000
Rock 'n' Roll Nightmare (also known as The Edge of Hell) is a 1987 Canadian direct-to-video horror film directed
by John Fasano, and stars heavy metal musician Jon Mikl Thor, Jillian Peri and Teresa Simpson.

16
01:13:46,666 --> 01:13:52,666
The film explores themes of supernatural, heavy metal, satan.

17
01:18:23,333 --> 01:18:29,333
The tone is dark.
